      <Tooltip placement="top" content="This is a tooltip">
        <div>Hover over me</div>
      </Tooltip>
      {/* More components here */}
    </TooltipProvider>
  );
};

export default MyComponent;
```

This solution ensures that only one Tooltip is open at a time, and it closes when the mouse leaves the Tooltip or moves to another Tooltip.

